      "text": "The latest developments in U.S. law were deemed insufficient by the Irish DPA.",
      "exactQuote": "The latest developments in U.S. law (which are supposed to ensure a higher level of protection for data transferred to the U.S.) were deemed insufficient by the Irish DPA, especially since some of the promised reforms have not yet been implemented.",
