    {
      "text": "The Irish DPA found that Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) pursuant to Article 46(2)(c) GDPR invoked by Meta Ireland could not compensate for the lack of an equivalent level of data protection.",
      "exactQuote": "Second, the Irish DPA found that Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) pursuant to Article 46(2)(c) GDPR invoked by Meta Ireland could not compensate for the lack of an equivalent level of data protection.",
