    {
      "text": "Meta Ireland could not rely on derogations under Article 49 GDPR.",
      "exactQuote": "Finally, Meta Ireland could not rely on derogations under Article 49 GDPR, as derogations to fundamental rights enshrined in the European Charter of Fundamental Rights shall be interpreted strictly.",
