      "exactQuote": "Moreover, according to the Irish DPC, derogations under Article 49 GDPR can only be invoked for 'occasional and non-repetitive' transfers, which was clearly not the case with the Meta group, whose business model is based on massive and continuous transatlantic exchanges of data.",
